\newlabel{fig:bfs-effort}{{6}{12}{Observed BFS search effort in the saved aggregate. Bar lengths use a linear scale and show median states expanded across attempts, including unsuccessful attempts. Budgets and repeated samples are not standardized by this aggregate; 358 of 725 attempts terminated in timeout. The lower hard-group median does not imply that hard instances require less search. Reference depth is not minimum solution length}{figure.6}{}}
